    "summary": "The Kelermorph, while outside enemy Engagement Range, may react once each turn during the enemy Movement phase. The trigger is a foe ending its move at most 8″ from the Kelermorph, whether it moved Normally, Advanced or Fell Back. If able, the Kelermorph can shoot that foe as in your Shooting phase, then move Normally up to D6″. Embarking in a TRANSPORT is forbidden as part of that move.",
